無楚憂，西無秦患，則齊危矣。韓、魏必輕齊畏秦，臣爲君危之。君不如令敝邑深合於秦，而君無攻，又無借兵食。君臨函谷而無攻，令敝邑以君之情謂秦昭王曰『薛公必不破秦以彊韓、魏。其攻秦也，欲王之令楚王割東國以與齊，而秦出楚懷王以爲和』。君令敝邑以此惠秦，秦得無破而以東國自免也，秦必欲之。楚王得出，必德齊。齊得東國益彊，而薛世世無患矣。秦不大弱，而處三晉之西，三晉必重齊。」薛公曰：「善。」因令韓、魏賀秦，使三國無攻，而不借兵食於西周矣。是時，楚懷王入秦，秦留之，故欲必出之。秦不果出楚懷王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"7s4_7ac_lhn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"蘇代","kind":"person","person_id":"2ih_dpv_yf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"7s4_7ac_lhn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0102","start":102,"end":103,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"7s4_7ac_lhn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"7s4_7ac_lhn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"7s4_7ac_lhn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"7s4_7ac_lhn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0140","start":140,"end":141,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"7s4_7ac_lhn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0144","start":144,"end":147,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"ajv_agq_es1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"薛公","kind":"person","person_id":"7s4_7ac_lhn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m009-0167","start":167,"end":168,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ajv_agq_